      CPO ANSWER: Path A — lock down first, then add /status. Implemented by mirroring the .claude/agents/** precedent exactly: .claude/commands/ added to task_contract_gate.py PROTECTED_PREFIXES; .claude/commands/** routed to cto-reviewer in review_routing.json + added to the opus-on-guards floor; protected/guard enumerations synced in working_agreement.md §2 + agent_guardrails.md.

