- (⭐ CPO DECISION: TWO SCOPE AMENDMENTS FOR ONE DEFECT, and the second overturned my fix)
  The full python suite was failing on
  `tests/test_metric_bindings.py::test_regenerated_json_matches_committed`, PRE-EXISTING on this
  branch and missed by six review rounds because no round ran the full suite — every one ran only
  `test_export_landing.py` and reported "15 python tests" as if it were the suite.

  Cause: the catalogue's grain is (metric_id, entity), but
  `scripts/export_metric_definitions_json.py::load_catalogue` keyed on `metric_id` alone, so the
